        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="One platform stack, one CloudFormation stack per student. The $80 cap is self-metered by the backend every 5 minutes &#8212; there is no AWS Budgets action in this design (see ADR-0002)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#5f6b7a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
